abstract: "A persistent allocation wheel restores split-versus-combined consistency lost under reset rotation. The artifact proves exact fiberwise pointer minimality, reachable allowance recovery, nondegenerate phase separation, finite-family predictive-summary bounds, one-lot balance, price-time conformance, and an analytic vanishing-lot limit, with dated regulatory traceability."
